From b0308236576119554372903620cd9cffad6b2dcc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 18:36:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Design v5 on staging: v4 reworked after three user interviews

v5 = v4 + interview-driven changes, staging only (production stays v4):
progress in words from the user's own check-ins with a two-week report
and detail on demand; no analytics on the player; a Why on every
suggested change; Aurelia says what the next chapter changes; wearable
asked for in onboarding (only that source on); optional journal; cards
describe the session, tags without #; challenge without ranks; publish
says what stays private; visitor Home without the map.

v1-v4 are pixel-identical (150 pairs, 402/1280).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Je1v64McNyB6XEu6gFgM4C
